en-line\",\"title\":\"100% Human Craftsmanship\",\"desc\":\"No generic AI-generated filler. Every piece is written, refined, and polished by seasoned industry writers with real editorial voice.\"},{\"icon\":\"ri-team-line\",\"title\":\"Writers Who Understand Business\",\"desc\":\"Our team blends editorial talent with commercial thinking. We know what sells, what ranks, and what resonates.\"},{\"icon\":\"ri-time-line\",\"title\":\"Deadlines Are Sacred\",\"desc\":\"In 8 years, we\'ve never missed a committed deadline. Reliability isn\'t a promise — it\'s part of our process.\"},{\"icon\":\"ri-bar-chart-grouped-line\",\"title\":\"Strategy, Not Just Content\",\"desc\":\"We don\'t write in a vacuum. Every piece connects to a broader goal — traffic, trust, conversions, or brand equity.\"},{\"icon\":\"ri-shield-check-line\",\"title\":\"Transparent & Accountable\",\"desc\":\"No black boxes. You see the plan, the progress, and the results. We communicate like partners, not vendors.\"},{\"icon\":\"ri-refresh-line\",\"title\":\"Consistent Voice, Every Time\",\"desc\":\"Whether it\'s blog #1 or blog #200, your brand voice stays sharp, on-strategy, and distinctly yours.\"}]','2026-08-24 05:35:00'),(366,'who_sec7_stats','[{\"count\":\"1000\",\"suffix\":\"+\",\"label\":\"Projects Delivered\"},{\"count\":\"170\",\"suffix\":\"+\",\"label\":\"Happy Clients\"},{\"count\":\"98\",\"suffix\":\"%\",\"label\":\"Client Retention Rate\"},{\"count\":\"8\",\"suffix\":\"+\",\"label\":\"Years of Excellence\"}]','2026-08-24 05:35:00'),(367,'who_sec8_badge','LET\'S MAKE SOMETHING MEANINGFUL','2026-08-24 05:35:00'),(368,'who_sec8_title','Start something <em>worth reading.</em>','2026-08-24 05:35:00'),(369,'who_sec8_desc','Tell us what you\'re building. We\'ll help you find the words to move it forward, engage the right audience, and drive sustainable pipeline growth.','2026-08-24 05:35:00'),(370,'who_sec8_btn1_text','Start a Conversation','2026-08-24 05:35:00'),(371,'who_sec8_btn1_url','contact.php','2026-08-24 05:35:00'),(372,'who_sec8_btn2_text','Explore Services','2026-08-24 05:35:00'),(373,'who_sec8_btn2_url','services.php','2026-08-24 05:35:00'),(374,'who_sec8_trust_pills','24h Response, NDA Protected, Free Content Audit','2026-08-24 05:35:00'),(375,'who_sec8_artwork','/uploads/about/wdr_6a8d68948cb569.54550898.png','2026-08-25 04:34:04'),(376,'hero_mode_home','slider','2026-08-24 05:40:38'),(377,'hero_mode_who_we_are','single','2026-08-25 00:55:05'),(378,'hero_mode_services','single','2026-08-25 00:57:10'),(379,'hero_mode_contact','single','2026-08-24 05:40:38'),(380,'hero_mode_blog','single','2026-08-24 09:55:48'),(389,'who_hero_video_url','','2026-08-24 06:12:39'),(401,'services_hero_video_url','','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(402,'services_sec2_badge','CORE EDITORIAL DISCIPLINES','2026-08-24 11:35:25'),(403,'services_sec2_title','Engineered for Depth. Refined for Impact.','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(404,'services_sec2_desc','Each discipline is led by specialized domain writers and subject-matter editors who understand the nuances of your industry.','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(405,'services_sec4_badge','OUR METHODOLOGY','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(406,'services_sec4_title','The 4-Stage Editorial Framework','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(407,'services_sec4_desc','How we transform a rough brief into authoritative, search-dominant, and commercially potent content.','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(408,'services_sec4_artwork','/img/process.png','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(409,'services_sec4_steps','[{\"num\":\"01\",\"title\":\"Discovery & Intent Audit\",\"desc\":\"We dissect your audience personas, buyer journey stages, competitor keyword gaps, and brand positioning requirements before writing a single word.\"},{\"num\":\"02\",\"title\":\"Architecture & Thesis\",\"desc\":\"Structuring topic clusters, semantic keyword mappings, thesis outlines, and editorial frameworks that give every piece strategic direction.\"},{\"num\":\"03\",\"title\":\"Human Craftsmanship\",\"desc\":\"Senior domain writers draft copy tailored to the exact rhythm, vocabulary, and technical expectations of your sector. Zero AI filler.\"},{\"num\":\"04\",\"title\":\"Fact-Checking & Polish\",\"desc\":\"Multi-layer editorial review, citation verification, search-intent audits, and two comprehensive revision cycles before delivery.\"}]','2026-08-25 05:49:58'),(410,'services_sec5_badge','THE EDITORIAL ADVANTAGE','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(411,'services_sec5_title','Commodity Content vs. Wordora Editorial','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(412,'services_sec5_desc','Why discerning market leaders partner with Wordora instead of generic freelance platforms or automated AI tools.','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(413,'services_sec5_table','[{\"pillar\":\"Research Depth\",\"commodity\":\"Surface-level summaries regurgitated from search snippets.\",\"wordora\":\"Primary data sourcing, expert quotes & academic synthesis.\"},{\"pillar\":\"Search Engine Intent\",\"commodity\":\"Keyword stuffing that gets flagged or demoted by Google.\",\"wordora\":\"Topic cluster architecture & high-intent conversion paths.\"},{\"pillar\":\"Voice & Nuance\",\"commodity\":\"Repetitive, robotic cadence with zero brand personality.\",\"wordora\":\"Bespoke tone governance matching your unique market stature.\"},{\"pillar\":\"Turnaround Governance\",\"commodity\":\"Unpredictable deadlines, ghosting, and endless rework.\",\"wordora\":\"Strict sprint schedules with dedicated managing editors.\"},{\"pillar\":\"Commercial ROI\",\"commodity\":\"Zero reader trust, high bounce rates, wasted budget.\",\"wordora\":\"High organic rankings, pipeline velocity & qualified inbound leads.\"}]','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(414,'services_sec6_badge','ENGAGEMENT MODELS','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(415,'services_sec6_title','Flexible Editorial Scopes','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(416,'services_sec6_desc','Whether you require a one-time brand manifesto or a high-velocity monthly content engine, we structure transparent, predictable engagements.','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(417,'services_sec6_tiers','[{\"badge\":\"Sprint Model\",\"title\":\"Topic Cluster Engine\",\"desc\":\"For growth-stage SaaS and B2B firms scaling organic search footprint and outranking incumbents.\",\"bullets\":\"4 In-Depth Long-Form Pillars (2,000+ words)\\nSemantic Keyword & Topic Map\\nMeta Descriptions & Schema Schematics\\n2 Full Rounds of Editorial Revisions\",\"btn_text\":\"Request Cluster Scope\",\"btn_url\":\"contact.php?plan=topic-cluster\",\"is_featured\":0},{\"badge\":\"Most Popular\",\"title\":\"Brand Voice & Launch\",\"desc\":\"Complete messaging architecture, website copy decks, and brand manifesto for new product launches.\",\"bullets\":\"Full Homepage & Core Service Copy\\nBrand Manifesto & Tagline Matrix\\nExecutive Pitch Deck Narrative\\nComprehensive Tone & Style Guide\",\"btn_text\":\"Request Launch Scope\",\"btn_url\":\"contact.php?plan=brand-voice\",\"is_featured\":1},{\"badge\":\"Executive Retainer\",\"title\":\"C-Suite Thought Leadership\",\"desc\":\"Ghostwriting for founders, managing partners, and venture leaders to build undeniable market authority.\",\"bullets\":\"Weekly Strategic LinkedIn Essays\\nMonthly Industry Whitepaper or Digest\\nMulti-Slide Figma Carousel Graphics\\nGhostwritten Op-Eds & Guest Posts\",\"btn_text\":\"Request Retainer Scope\",\"btn_url\":\"contact.php?plan=executive-thought-leadership\",\"is_featured\":0}]','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(418,'services_sec7_badge','FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(419,'services_sec7_title','Everything You Need to Know','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(420,'services_sec7_desc','Clear answers on how we scope, draft, refine, and deliver high-impact content.','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(421,'services_sec7_artwork','/img/FAQ 2.png','2026-09-05 10:49:47'),(422,'services_sec7_faqs','[{\"q\":\"How do you ensure writers understand our complex domain?\",\"a\":\"Every project is assigned to a professional writer with relevant experience in your domain, including computer science, finance, gaming, and more. We conduct a comprehensive discovery interview and review your technical documentation before writing to ensure accurate, high-quality content.\"},{\"q\":\"What is your policy on AI-generated content?\",\"a\":\"100% human-crafted and fact-checked. We use technology only for semantic keyword clustering and grammar audits. Every sentence, thesis, and argument is constructed by experienced human journalists and editors.\"},{\"q\":\"How many revisions are included in a project scope?\",\"a\":\"All scopes include two complete rounds of revisions within 14 days of delivery. Because we align on detailed outlines beforehand, most deliverables are approved on the first review.\"},{\"q\":\"Do you sign Non-Disclosure Agreements (NDAs)?\",\"a\":\"Yes, unconditionally. We protect all proprietary data, pre-release roadmaps, and ghostwriting arrangements under strict mutual NDAs.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the typical turnaround timeline?\",\"a\":\"We also work on tight deadlines. Most projects are delivered within 5–10 business days, depending on the scope. Blog posts typically take 3–5 days, while full brand copy packages may take 2–3 weeks. We always discuss and agree on the timeline upfront, so you know when to expect your project.\"}]','2026-08-25 04:55:04'),(423,'services_sec8_badge','READY TO ELEVATE YOUR WORDS?','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(424,'services_sec8_title','Let\'s build content worth reading.','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(425,'services_sec8_desc','Tell us about your brand, your goals, and what you need written. We\'ll deliver a tailored proposal within 24 hours.','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(426,'services_sec8_btn1_text','Start a Conversation','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(427,'services_sec8_btn1_url','contact.php','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(428,'services_sec8_btn2_text','Our Editorial Story','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(429,'services_sec8_btn2_url','who-we-are.php','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(430,'services_sec8_artwork','/img/cta 1.png','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(431,'services_sec8_pills','[{\"icon\":\"ri-checkbox-circle-fill\",\"text\":\"24h Response\"},{\"icon\":\"ri-shield-check-fill\",\"text\":\"NDA Protected\"},{\"icon\":\"ri-file-list-3-fill\",\"text\":\"Free Content Audit\"}]','2026-08-24 06:20:35'),(456,'hero_gradient_coverage','60','2026-08-25 05:54:48'),(527,'careers_hero_badge','JOIN OUR GLOBAL EDITORIAL COLLECTIVE','2026-08-24 07:40:14'),(528,'careers_hero_title','Build The Future of Editorial Authority & Brand Narrative','2026-08-24 07:40:14'),(529,'careers_hero_desc','We are hiring world-class technical writers, investigative editors, SEO topic architects, and creative copywriters to author high-stakes content for top-tier brands worldwide.','2026-08-24 07:40:14'),(530,'careers_hero_image','/uploads/careers/wdr_6a8d4bc6570489.18452599.png','2026-08-25 02:31:10'),(531,'careers_perks','[{\"icon\":\"ri-global-line\",\"title\":\"100% Remote Global\",\"desc\":\"Work from anywhere on Earth\"},{\"icon\":\"ri-wallet-3-line\",\"title\":\"Top 10% Compensation\",\"desc\":\"Competitive INR pay & performance bonuses\"},{\"icon\":\"ri-book-open-line\",\"title\":\"Annual Learning Stipend\",\"desc\":\"Books, courses & hardware allowance\"},{\"icon\":\"ri-time-line\",\"title\":\"Async & Flexible Hours\",\"desc\":\"Zero timesheets or useless meetings\"}]','2026-08-24 07:40:14'),(532,'careers_jobs_badge','CURRENT OPPORTUNITIES','2026-08-24 07:40:14'),(533,'careers_jobs_title','9 Open Roles Across 4 Disciplines','2026-08-24 07:40:14'),(534,'careers_jobs_desc','Explore our active remote openings. Every position includes full async flexibility and competitive compensation.','2026-08-24 07:40:14'),(535,'careers_jobs','[{\"id\":1,\"slug\":\"content-writer-seo-editorial\",\"title\":\"Content Writer — SEO & Editorial Content\",\"department\":\"Content Writing\",\"department_slug\":\"content-writing\",\"type\":\"Full-Time\",\"location\":\"100% Remote Global\",\"salary\":\"\",\"equity\":\"Performance Bonus Included\",\"experience\":\"4–5 Years+\",\"tags\":[\"SEO Writing\",\"SaaS Content\",\"Blog Writing\",\"Content Strategy\",\"Research\",\"Copywriting\",\"GEO\",\"Editorial Writing\"],\"excerpt\":\"Create high-quality, research-driven SEO and editorial content for global SaaS, technology, and B2B brands, turning complex topics into clear, engaging, high-authority content.\",\"overview\":\"As a Content Writer, you will work with editors, strategists, and subject-matter experts to create high-quality blogs, thought-leadership articles, website content, and long-form resources for global SaaS, technology, and B2B brands. You should be comfortable researching complex topics, understanding search intent, and producing content that is both useful to readers and optimized for modern search and AI discovery.\",\"responsibilities\":[\"Conduct in-depth research and create accurate, engaging, and original content across technology, SaaS, business, and B2B topics.\",\"Write SEO-focused blog articles, thought-leadership pieces, landing pages, and long-form editorial content.\",\"Work closely with senior editors and content strategists to follow briefs, editorial guidelines, and brand voice.\",\"Analyze search intent, competitor content, and relevant sources to build authoritative and useful articles.\",\"Translate complex technical or business concepts into clear, easy-to-understand content.\",\"Revise content based on editorial feedback while maintaining accuracy, originality, and consistency.\"],\"is_active\":1}]','2026-08-25 07:03:00'),(536,'careers_pillars_badge','OUR WORKING PHILOSOPHY','2026-08-24 07:40:14'),(537,'careers_pillars_title','Built For Writers Who Care Deeply About Craft','2026-08-24 07:40:14'),(538,'careers_pillars_desc','We don\'t do agency churn or AI prompt-spinning. We operate as an elite editorial guild with uncompromising standards, fair compensation, and radical autonomy.','2026-08-24 07:40:14'),(539,'careers_pillars','[{\"icon\":\"ri-compass-3-line\",\"title\":\"100% Async Freedom\",\"desc\":\"No micromanagement or daily standups. We align on scope and deadlines, and you choose when and where you write best.\"},{\"icon\":\"ri-quill-pen-line\",\"title\":\"Uncompromising Rigor\",\"desc\":\"Every article is backed by primary source research, verified data citations, and senior editor QA. You\'ll produce work you\'re proud of.\"},{\"icon\":\"ri-wallet-3-line\",\"title\":\"Top 10% Compensation\",\"desc\":\"We pay transparent, highly competitive INR compensation with annual profit sharing, milestone bonuses, and tech allowances.\"},{\"icon\":\"ri-rocket-2-line\",\"title\":\"Tier-1 Global Brands\",\"desc\":\"Write for venture-backed Silicon Valley SaaS leaders, European FinTech scaleups, and prestigious institutions.\"}]','2026-08-24 07:40:14'),(540,'careers_protocol_badge','OUR 4-STAGE HIRING PROTOCOL','2026-08-24 07:40:14'),(541,'careers_protocol_title','Transparent, Fast & Respectful of Your Time','2026-08-24 07:40:14'),(542,'careers_protocol_desc','We respond to every candidate application within 48 hours. No 7-round interview marathons.','2026-08-24 07:40:14'),(543,'careers_protocol','[{\"num\":\"01\",\"sla\":\"48-Hour SLA\",\"title\":\"Portfolio Review\",\"desc\":\"Our editors review your writing samples, resume, and domain background.\"},{\"num\":\"02\",\"sla\":\"30 Mins\",\"title\":\"Discovery Call\",\"desc\":\"A relaxed 30-minute conversation about your craft, goals, and workflow.\"},{\"num\":\"03\",\"sla\":\"Paid Sprint\",\"title\":\"Paid Micro-Sprint\",\"desc\":\"We never ask for free spec work. You complete a paid 800-word test article.\"},{\"num\":\"04\",\"sla\":\"Offer\",\"title\":\"Offer & Onboarding\",\"desc\":\"Contract execution, equipment stipend, and warm team introduction.\"}]','2026-08-24 07:40:14'),(548,'contact_form_badge','PROJECT SCOPE INQUIRY','2026-08-24 08:05:02'),(549,'contact_form_title','Send Us a Project Brief','2026-08-24 08:05:02'),(550,'contact_form_desc','Fill out the details below and our managing editor will prepare a customized proposal.','2026-08-24 08:05:02'),(551,'contact_form_services','[\"SEO Content Writing\",\"Technical Writing\",\"Brand Copywriting\",\"Thought Leadership\",\"Social Media Content\",\"Email Marketing\",\"Full Retainer\"]','2026-08-24 08:05:02'),(552,'contact_form_note','We never share your information. Protected by strict mutual NDA.','2026-08-24 08:05:02'),(553,'contact_showcase_image','/img/contact from.png','2026-08-24 08:05:02'),(554,'contact_showcase_title','Dedicated Managing Editor Access','2026-08-24 08:05:02'),(555,'contact_showcase_desc','Every client is paired with an industry-specialist managing editor who oversees research, voice alignment, and delivery milestones.','2026-08-24 08:05:02'),(556,'contact_info_cards','[{\"icon\":\"ri-mail-star-line\",\"label\":\"Direct Email\",\"value\":\"info@wordora.in\",\"link_type\":\"email\"},{\"icon\":\"ri-phone-line\",\"label\":\"Dedicated Line\",\"value\":\"+91-7023610099\",\"link_type\":\"phone\"},{\"icon\":\"ri-map-pin-line\",\"label\":\"Studio HQ\",\"value\":\"Jaipur, Rajasthan, India\",\"link_type\":\"none\"},{\"icon\":\"ri-time-line\",\"label\":\"Response SLA\",\"value\":\"Under 24 Hours\",\"link_type\":\"none\"}]','2026-08-25 02:39:11'),(557,'contact_enterprise_badge','Enterprise SLA','2026-08-24 08:05:02'),(558,'contact_enterprise_title','Need an Urgent Custom Briefing?','2026-08-24 08:05:02'),(559,'contact_enterprise_desc','We can execute mutual NDAs within 2 hours and initiate multi-author topic cluster production within 5 business days.','2026-08-24 08:05:02'),(560,'contact_enterprise_btn_text','Email Enterprise Desk Directly','2026-08-24 08:05:02'),(561,'contact_enterprise_btn_url','mailto:info@wordora.in?subject=Urgent%20Enterprise%20Content%20Scope','2026-09-05 04:31:23'),(562,'contact_faq_badge','FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS','2026-08-24 08:05:02'),(563,'contact_faq_title','Everything You Need to Know','2026-08-24 08:05:02'),(564,'contact_faq_desc','Clear answers to common questions about our scopes, writer matchmaking, and delivery turnarounds.','2026-08-24 08:05:02'),(565,'contact_faq_image','/img/FAQ 2.png','2026-09-05 10:49:47'),(566,'contact_faqs','[{\"q\":\"How fast can our project kick off after signing?\",\"a\":\"Most engagements kick off within 48 to 72 hours. We immediately assign a dedicated managing editor, schedule your voice calibration interview, and build your initial 60-day topic roadmap.\"},{\"q\":\"Do you offer revisions and editorial style adjustments?\",\"a\":\"Yes. Every piece includes 2 structured rounds of revisions at no extra cost. We also build a custom brand stylebook for your company so subsequent deliverables align seamlessly with your voice.\"},{\"q\":\"How do you guarantee 100% human, zero-AI craftsmanship?\",\"a\":\"Every article is written by verified domain specialists with deep subject matter backgrounds. All pieces pass through a 4-tier editorial QA protocol, including Turnitin similarity audits and primary source citation checks.\"},{\"q\":\"Can you handle large-volume enterprise content scaling?\",\"a\":\"Yes. We have a team of professional writers who can scale to handle 10+ articles per month while maintaining quality and brand consistency.\"},{\"q\":\"Do we own 100% of the intellectual property?\",\"a\":\"Upon final delivery and payment settlement, all copyright, intellectual property, and publication rights transfer fully and unconditionally to your organization.\"}]','2026-08-25 04:52:09'),(568,'hero_mode_case_studies','single','2026-08-24 09:55:48'),(603,'seo_home_title','WORDORA —Words That Work. Stories That Sell.','2026-08-24 11:56:12'),(604,'seo_home_desc','Professional content writing and editorial services that convert readers into clients.','2026-08-24 11:55:45'),(605,'seo_home_keywords','ontent strategy, SEO copywriting, editorial agency','2026-08-24 11:55:45'),(606,'seo_home_og_image','/img/wordorga logo.png','2026-08-24 11:41:33'),(607,'seo_who_we_are_title','Who We Are','2026-08-24 11:43:04'),(608,'seo_who_we_are_desc','Meet 